    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/e/csm_josua_schade_9179cf0129.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">在ZOLLER，我们始终致力于将硬件与软件完美契合用户需求。因此，我们能够提供一站式、以实践为导向的解决方案。</p> <p><strong>Josua Schade，TMS硬件产品管理</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/b/csm_sarah-michelle_wiacek_c4c06a6999.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">位于德国普莱德尔斯海姆的ZOLLER装配团队每天都全力以赴，确保您的ZOLLER Smart Cabinets始终保持高品质。能参与其中，真是太棒了！</p> <p><strong>Sarah-Michelle Wiacek，生产准备团队</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/9/csm_michael_haas_a5847acaff.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">借助ZOLLER Smart Cabinets，我们的ZOLLER客户不仅能提高效率，还能避免在生产过程中出现错误。</p> <p><strong>Michael Haas，ZOLLER 南部销售部</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
